<div class="card mb-5">
  <div class="card-header py-3">
    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Set up M-Pesa payments</h5>
  </div>

  <div class="card-body p-4">
    <p class="mb-4">
      This is a one-time setup. Once complete, customer payments are deposited
      to your M-Pesa account automatically. The steps could be a bit technical,
      but totally doable. 
    </p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2">What you will need</h6>
    <p class="mb-2">Four values from your Safaricom account, entered in the fields below:</p>
    <ol class="mb-2 ps-3">
      <li class="mb-1">Business Shortcode (your Paybill or Till number)</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Consumer Key</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Consumer Secret</li>
      <li class="mb-1">Passkey</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">For security, only the account owner can obtain these from Safaricom.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3">Steps</h6>
    <ol class="mb-4 ps-3">
      <li class="mb-3">
        <strong>Confirm your M-Pesa business shortcode.</strong>
        If you do not have a Paybill or Till, register one on the M-Pesa
        self-onboarding portal or at a Safaricom shop. 
      </li>
      <li class="mb-3">
        <strong>Create a developer account.</strong>
        Sign up at
        <a href="https://developer.safaricom.co.ke" target="_blank" rel="noopener">developer.safaricom.co.ke</a>
        using the phone number registered to your shortcode.
      </li>
      <li class="mb-3">
        <strong>Complete Go Live.</strong>
        Select Go Live, enter your shortcode, and verify with the code sent to
        your phone.
      </li>
      <li class="mb-3">
        <strong>Retrieve your credentials.</strong>
        Safaricom emails your Passkey. Your Consumer Key and Consumer Secret are
        listed under My Apps.
      </li>
      <li class="mb-0">
        <strong>Enter the four values below and save.</strong>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="alert alert-light border mb-0" role="alert">
      <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2">Need help?</h6>
      <p class="mb-2">
        Safaricom M-Pesa Business support can guide you through Go Live and
        credential retrieval:
      </p>
      <ul class="mb-2">
        <li class="mb-1">Call 2222 from a Safaricom line, or 0722 002 222 from any phone.</li>
        <li class="mb-1">Email <a href="mailto:M-PESAbusiness@safaricom.co.ke">M-PESAbusiness@safaricom.co.ke</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-0 text-muted">
        A developer or IT administrator can also complete these steps on your
        behalf using your shortcode. Funds are always deposited to your own
        M-Pesa account.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
